# Backend API URL (your deployed backend/ service URL). Required for Pai chat,
# haiku generation, the contact form, and the Digital Twin call — nothing that
# talks to the backend works without this set.
VITE_API_URL=https://your-backend.onrender.com

# That's it for the frontend. ElevenLabs and Simli keys for the Digital Twin
# "Talk to PK" feature live in backend/.env (see backend.env.example) — they
# stay server-side so the keys never ship in the client bundle.
